%% MUPP-064 Wish rows fold out consistently
%% What a wish row shows when it is unfolded (children's lists and match page).
flowchart TD
    A[Collapsed row: title and chevron, every row] --> B[Press the row]
    B --> C{Claimed? children's list only}
    C -- yes --> D[Paxad av name and time, R4]
    C -- no --> E
    D --> E[Beskrivning: value or dash, R2]
    E --> F[Storlek: value or dash, R2]
    F --> G{http or https address?}
    G -- yes --> H[Länk till presenten, R3]
    G -- no --> I[No link line, R3]
    H --> J[Press again: collapsed]
    I --> J
